    <script type="application/ld+json">{"mainEntity":{"headline":"Covalent organic frameworks with ultra-broadband absorption for efficient solar-driven water evaporation","description":"Covalent organic frameworks (COFs) demonstrate application prospects in solar-driven water evaporation (SDWE). Nevertheless, the reported COFs intrinsically lack the capacity to harvest infrared light, which results in inferior photothermal conversion efficiency and thereby retards the water evaporation rate. Here we report a class of Cl-functionalized COFs with ultra-broadband absorption spanning 200–1,500 nm and strong non-radiative relaxation capacity for enhancing SDWE performance. The synthesized TTB-pPA COFs (where TTB is 2,4,6-trichloro-1,3,5-trialdehyde benzene and pPA is p-phenylenediamine) exhibit a notable temperature rise to 125.3 °C within 60 s under 1-sun illumination, superior to that of COFs without Cl atom (60.7 °C). The SDWE device was constructed by using TTB-pPA COFs as photothermal conversion layer, showing an elevated water evaporation rate of 7.62 kg m−2 h−1, which significantly outperform previously reported water evaporation device. Furthermore, the custom-developed water evaporation device demonstrates long-term stability of 60 days under natural light conditions, together with the pure water production (impurity content <0.1%) of 30–45 l m−2 d−1, which can meet the drinking water needs of 12–18 people. Overall, this work emphasizes the significance of designing COFs with a broad light absorption range and strong non-radiative electron decay capability in enhancing solar-powered seawater desalination capability. This study introduces chlorine-functionalized covalent organic frameworks capable of absorbing a broad range of sunlight and efficiently converting it to heat, dramatically improving solar-driven water evaporation and enabling stable, high-purity freshwater production for practical desalination.","datePublished":"2026-09-17T00:00:00Z","dateModified":"2026-09-17T00:00:00Z","pageStart":"1157","pageEnd":"1165","sameAs":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s44221-026-00687-w","keywords":["Artificial photosynthesis","Pollution remediation","Physical Chemistry"],"image":["https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1038%2Fs44221-026-00687-w/MediaObjects/44221_2026_687_Fig1_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1038%2Fs44221-026-00687-w/MediaObjects/44221_2026_687_Fig2_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1038%2Fs44221-026-00687-w/MediaObjects/44221_2026_687_Fig3_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1038%2Fs44221-026-00687-w/MediaObjects/44221_2026_687_Fig4_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1038%2Fs44221-026-00687-w/MediaObjects/44221_2026_687_Fig5_HTML.png"],"isPartOf":{"name":"Nature Water","issn":["2731-6084"],"volumeNumber":"4","@type":["Periodical","PublicationVolume"]},"publisher":{"name":"Nature Publishing Group UK","logo":{"url":"https://www.springernature.com/app-sn/public/images/logo-springernature.png","@type":"ImageObject"},"@type":"Organization"},"author":[{"name":"Yachao Xu","url":"http://orcid.org/0009-0001-7684-9997","affiliation":[{"name":"Peking University","address":{"name":"School of Materials Science and Engineering, Peking University, Beijing, China","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Zhong Zhou","url":"http://orcid.org/0009-0009-3464-6487","affiliation":[{"name":"Beijing University of Chemical Technology","address":{"name":"Beijing Key Laboratory of Electrochemical Process and Technology for Materials, Beijing University of Chemical Technology, Beijing, China","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Shanghai Jiao Tong University","address":{"name":"School of Materials Science and Engineering, Shanghai Jiao Tong University, Shanghai, China","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Bojing Sun","affiliation":[{"name":"China Three Gorges University","address":{"name":"College of Materials and Chemical Engineering, Key Laboratory of Inorganic Nonmetallic Crystalline and Energy Conversion Materials, China Three Gorges University, Yichang, China","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Qinqin Li","url":"http://orcid.org/0009-0002-2141-6411","affiliation":[{"name":"Beijing University of Chemical Technology","address":{"name":"Beijing Key Laboratory of Electrochemical Process and Technology for Materials, Beijing University of Chemical Technology, Beijing, China","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Ying Wang","affiliation":[{"name":"Harbin Normal University","address":{"name":"School of Physics and Electronic Engineering, Harbin Normal University, Harbin, China","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Ruolan Zhao","affiliation":[{"name":"Harbin Normal University","address":{"name":"School of Physics and Electronic Engineering, Harbin Normal University, Harbin, China","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Zheng Lin","affiliation":[{"name":"Peking University","address":{"name":"School of Materials Science and Engineering, Peking University, Beijing, China","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Zongqiang Sun","affiliation":[{"name":"Peking University","address":{"name":"School of Materials Science and Engineering, Peking University, Beijing, China","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Youxing Liu","url":"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-4407-8785","affiliation":[{"name":"Peking University","address":{"name":"School of Materials Science and Engineering, Peking University, Beijing, China","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Beijing University of Chemical Technology","address":{"name":"Beijing Key Laboratory of Electrochemical Process and Technology for Materials, Beijing University of Chemical Technology, Beijing, China","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"email":"liuyxpost@pku.edu.cn","@type":"Person"},{"name":"Hongbo Li","url":"http://orcid.org/0000-0002-3378-0870","affiliation":[{"name":"Beijing Institute of Technology","address":{"name":"School of Materials Science and Engineering, Beijing Institute of Technology, Beijing, China","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"email":"hongbo.li@bit.edu.cn","@type":"Person"},{"name":"Shaojun Guo","url":"http://orcid.org/0000-0002-5941-414X","affiliation":[{"name":"Peking University","address":{"name":"School of Materials Science and Engineering, Peking University, Beijing, China","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"email":"guosj@pku.edu.cn","@type":"Person"}],"isAccessibleForFree":false,"hasPart":{"isAccessibleForFree":false,"cssSelector":".main-content","@type":"WebPageElement"},"@type":"ScholarlyArticle"},"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage"}</script>




    
    
