            </div></div></section><section data-title="Peer review"><div class="c-article-section" id="peer-review-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="peer-review">Peer review</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="peer-review-content">
              
              
                <h3 class="c-article__sub-heading" id="FPar1">Peer review information</h3>
                <p><i>Nature Water</i> thanks Dan Tian and the other, anonymous, reviewer(s) for their contribution to the peer review of this work. <a data-track="click" data-track-label="link" data-track-action="supplementary material anchor" href="/articles/s44221-026-00687-w#MOESM3">Peer reviewer reports</a> are available.</p>
              
